  "facts": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "text": "Turpin Hills’ development kicked off in spring 1956, turning a steep, heavily wooded hillside into a planned community.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        23,
        25
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 1"
      ],
      "source": "https://turpinhills.org/about/turpin-hills-history/"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "The first sign on the site read “for sale,” announcing the new name Turpin Hills to passing motorists.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        24
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 1"
      ],
      "source": "https://turpinhills.org/about/turpin-hills-history/"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "At its start, the only entrance was a rutted‑gravel farm road off Clough Pike, cutting through the hillside.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        26
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 1"
      ],
      "source": "https://turpinhills.org/about/turpin-hills-history/"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "That original road ran parallel to the right side of the present road before cutting diagonally left across the road several hundred feet above Lengel.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        27
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 1"
      ],
      "source": "https://turpinhills.org/about/turpin-hills-history/"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "After dissecting lots 6036 and 6050, the old road continued up the left side to a 300‑acre farm that now sits at the intersection of Turpin Hills and Saddleback Drives.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        28,
        29
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 1"
      ],
      "source": "https://turpinhills.org/about/turpin-hills-history/"
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "text": "Today, parts of that original roadbed are still visible on some lots, a subtle reminder of Turpin Hills’ early layout.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        30
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 1"
      ],
      "source": "https://turpinhills.org/about/turpin-hills-history/"
